9
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:13,055
B. Food and water.

10
00:00:13,055 --> 00:00:15,049
Pure problem-solver. Your brain

11
00:00:15,049 --> 00:00:16,371
turns fear into a

12
00:00:16,371 --> 00:00:16,908
