13
00:00:17,258 --> 00:00:18,422
C. The radio. You

14
00:00:18,422 --> 00:00:20,050
don't survive alone. When

15
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,341
you're scared, you reach

16
00:00:21,341 --> 00:00:22,007
for people.

17
00:00:22,257 --> 00:00:23,731
Psychologists call it tend

18
00:00:23,731 --> 00:00:25,118
